<title>LATVIA: Latvian May CPI mo/mo 0.6 pct, yr/yr 9.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Latvian May CPI mo/mo 0.6 pct, yr/yr 9.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Latvia was running at 0.6 percent month-on-month in May for a year-on-year rise of 9.1 percent, the statistics committee said on Friday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN INFLATION		MAY '97   APRIL '97   MAY' 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)  +0.6	+0.7	  +0.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)    +9.1	+8.8	  +17.4</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
